    "accessibility": {
      "short": "Pointillist painting of people relaxing in a riverside park with trees, umbrellas, and boats.",
      "long": "A horizontally oriented painting showing a crowded park scene under bright daylight. The image is built from thousands of tiny colored dots. In the foreground, a man reclines on grass next to a seated woman and two black dogs; a standing woman in a dark dress holds a black parasol. Midground features groups of people sitting and standing under green trees, some holding red, blue, or black parasols. In the background, a calm river hosts small sailboats and rowboats, with more distant figures along the far bank. The color palette is dominated by vibrant greens and yellows for the grass and foliage, contrasting with deep blues, blacks, and reds in clothing and accessories.",
